IP

Header:
Ver | IHL | DSCP/ECN | Len | ID | Flags | FragOff | TTL | Proto | Cksum | Src | Dst

-   TTL decremented per hop (traceroute). Header checksum covers header only.

Private: 10/8, 172.16/12, 192.168/16 · Loopback 127/8 · Link-local 169.254/16
· Multicast 224/4

Fragmentation: offset in 8-byte units; MF=1 except last; reassemble only at
destination; DF → ICMP → PMTUD.

NAT: rewrites IP:port, keeps table; breaks inbound connections/IPsec AH.

Companions:

-   DNS: name→IP, UDP/53, cache+TTL, root→TLD→authoritative.
-   ARP: IP→MAC in LAN, broadcast ask / unicast reply, spoofable.
-   DHCP: DORA (Discover, Offer, Request, Ack).
-   ICMP: errors + ping/traceroute, no ports.

IPv6: 128-bit, 40-B header, no checksum, no router fragmentation; NDP replaces
ARP; SLAAC.

