                Distance vector      Link state
  ------------- -------------------- ----------------
  Knows         neighbors' vectors   full topology
  Algorithm     Bellman-Ford         Dijkstra
  Convergence   slow, loops          fast, no loops
  Example       RIP (max 15)         OSPF, IS-IS

Count-to-infinity fixes: split horizon, poisoned reverse, triggered updates,
hold-down, path vector.

CIDR: longest-prefix match; aggregate contiguous blocks; provider-based →
