BGP (TCP/179, path vector):

1.  highest LOCAL_PREF
2.  shortest AS_PATH
3.  lowest ORIGIN
4.  lowest MED
5.  eBGP > iBGP
6.  lowest IGP cost to next hop
7.  lowest router ID

AS_PATH = loop detection. Valley-free = no free transit. No origin auth →
hijacks; RPKI/ROV.

